# Cameo ISO package set.
#
# Versions are pinned per GPU tier during Phase 5; this is the baseline set.
# Confirm the ROCm / kernel / mesa combination against scripts/phase1 results
# before shipping — the whole point of Cameo is a validated combination.

# Base system
base
linux
linux-firmware
linux-headers
mkinitcpio
sudo

# AMD graphics + Vulkan userspace (the universal baseline — every tier)
mesa
vulkan-radeon
vulkan-icd-loader
vulkan-tools
# VA-API comes from `mesa` itself — the standalone libva-mesa-driver package no
# longer exists upstream, it is only a virtual provide now.

# ROCm stack (Tier 1/2). Heavy; Phase 5 may move this to a post-install step
# so Tier 3 images stay small.
rocm-hip-sdk
rocminfo
rocm-smi-lib

# Build + runtime deps for llama.cpp / PyTorch
git
cmake
ninja
base-devel
curl
python
python-pytorch-rocm

# NOTE: the `cameo` CLI package itself is injected by the build pipeline once
# packaged (cargo build --release -> PKGBUILD). See archiso/README.md.
